- entry .JavaLongInstant   a bare `Long` as an instant, counting milliseconds since the epoch
-     An object which is `Long is Abstractable across Instants to Long` and `Long is
-     Instantiable across Instants from Long`, both the identity, offered as the given
-     `instantInterfaces.javaLongInstant`, imported by name. It is what lets an instant be
-     taken or given as the raw `System.currentTimeMillis` form. Note the asymmetry with
-     `JavaLongDuration`, whose `Long` counts nanoseconds. Its members `apply` and `genericize`
-     both return their argument unchanged.
+ entry .JavaLongInstant   un `Long` desnudo como instante, que cuenta milisegundos desde la época
+     Un objeto que es `Long is Abstractable across Instants to Long` y `Long is
+     Instantiable across Instants from Long`, ambos la identidad, que se ofrece como el given
+     `instantInterfaces.javaLongInstant`, importado por nombre. Es lo que permite tomar o dar un
+     instante en la forma en bruto de `System.currentTimeMillis`. Nótese la asimetría con
+     `JavaLongDuration`, cuyo `Long` cuenta nanosegundos. Sus miembros `apply` y `genericize`
+     devuelven ambos su argumento sin cambios.

=     both return their argument unchanged.
